Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.29,0:21:19.22,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}我能就像现在这样吗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.47,0:21:20.93,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}好想被爱
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.93,0:21:27.31,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}哪怕抛下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.77,0:21:31.02,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}从未和他人拼凑在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.02,0:21:33.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}诉说着话语  却无法沟通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.82,0:21:36.78,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}无法融入这世界的「理所当然」
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.07,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}也找不到归处
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.20,0:21:42.28,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}没有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}总是顾及别人的视线
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.83,0:21:47.70,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.70,0:21:50.21,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}在自己身上涂改
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.21,0:21:53.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}将自己的名字刻在心里
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.33,0:21:57.38,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}将那个不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.55,0:22:03.64,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}留在过去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.18,0:22:09.98,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.98,0:22:12.31,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.31,0:22:15.44,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}离开这逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.44,0:22:21.40,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs55}渴求着爱而颤抖着的心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.53,0:22:25.53,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs55}将因照耀着明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.58,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}而熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.50,0:22:39.26,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}我也一定会是某个人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.29,0:21:19.22,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.47,0:21:20.93,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.93,0:21:27.31,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.77,0:21:31.02,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.02,0:21:33.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.82,0:21:36.78,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.07,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.20,0:21:42.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.83,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.83,0:21:47.70,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.70,0:21:50.21,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.21,0:21:53.33,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.33,0:21:57.38,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.55,0:22:03.64,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.18,0:22:09.98,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.98,0:22:12.31,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.31,0:22:15.44,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.44,0:22:21.40,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.53,0:22:25.53,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.58,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.50,0:22:39.26,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:19.22,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}我能就像现在这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:20.93,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}好想被爱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:27.31,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}哪怕抛下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:31.02,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}从未和他人拼凑在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:33.82,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}诉说着话语  却无法沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:36.78,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}无法融入这世界的「理所当然」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.07,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}也找不到归处
